    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλοχρήμᾰτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loving money,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				And.
				4.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				68c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				82c
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					549b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				2p.422M.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. καὶ χρηματισταὶ οἱ ἐν ταῖς ἀρχαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1316a40
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοχρηματία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				436a
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.45
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.94
				</span></i>
			. Adv., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλοχρημά̆τ-τως</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοχρηματεῖν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.23
			</span></i>.</div>
